{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"The nameless opens his eyes and notices himself once again in the spirit world, this time not of his volition. The memory of his death scarred deeply into his mind, Irynx had something to do with it. He gazes around and sees Yggdrasil's roots and the great dragon once more.","created_at":"2021-07-28T07:46:23.710000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869848249626918942","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Did you kill the priestesses and bring me here?\" The nameless addresses Nidhoggur, still ignorant to the reason of his death.","created_at":"2021-07-28T07:46:49.733000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T07:58:18.090000Z","id":"869848358775320597","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"<@340062533304057857> Apparently your are as unlucky in life as in death.","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:39:52.421000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870088200352313384","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"That couldn't have been just bad luck. Plus, that message was clearly from Irynx or Willow. Tell me what happened to them.\" The nameless says, a little angry as he still thinks the party was killed by Nidhogg.","created_at":"2021-07-29T02:32:29.447000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870131640867909693","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"They have arrived in the land of the living. As shall you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:27:49.460000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870145566011686953","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"(your only choice for rez will be a dragon born or kobold.)","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:28:17.361000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870145683036971050","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"You will remain speaker of the Dead. That may be useful to me in the future.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:29:09.183000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870145900394209280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"<@!340062533304057857>","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:29:18.326000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870145938742730792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"The nameless sighs a small breath of relief before hardening his emotions. \"Tell me now what you plan to do with our deal. How does that affect me?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:31:20.756000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870146452251373669","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"No. No part of the deal required any amount of explanation. Consider your self at my service indefinably.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:32:26.081000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870146726244266025","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"For now you are under a geas not to speak to anyone who knows the name Irynx the Priestess of the Ravens about me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:33:57.747000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870147110719328286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"But I did ask for help in bringing the ravens back.\" The nameless growls. \"And what help did I receive? Opening your mouth was just you bringing me to them.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:33:59.129000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870147116515885117","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"The Ravens are back. My contract is fulfilled.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:34:22.145000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870147213051981866","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Through no voluntary effort from you I'd assume. If Irynx and the others did return safely and here you yet stand before me, another deal was struck, you got something. I do not consider that helping me, that was just helping yourself.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:35:11.647000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-29T03:38:52.396000Z","id":"870147420678393987","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I myself brought the priestess back to the land of the living.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:38:39.274000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870148291529162815","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"And it is not your place to judge the contract.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:39:11.168000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870148425302302750","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"A contract is dealt between two parties. There was no outside authority to judge us. I ask for more from you, what you did for me is not worth indefinite service.\" The nameless growls out, the frustration pent up inside of him pushing him on.","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:40:17.237000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870148702415765534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Between the demigod of Niflhel who has the power to bring you forth once more into the land of the living, and the broken impetious soul there ought to be a speck of respect, ephemeral.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:44:46.954000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870149833690841148","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Or perhaps I ought to deliver you back to my former realm instead of your resurrection.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:45:47.552000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870150087857278977","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Other servants can be found.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:45:57.397000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870150129150226543","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"It is not disrespect that makes me ask for more. Respect is not cowering, it is something given amongst equals. I respect you by showing that I am not afraid, that I will bring my all to the table.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:47:34.030000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870150534458409041","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Wouldn't you prefer a servant with some spine?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:48:08.365000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870150678469816390","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Deference then. I prefer a servant who has the wisdom to fear he who is able.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:50:03.352000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870151160760270909","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Make no mistake. Ephemeral. You are temporary. I am eternal.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:50:33.055000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870151285343649893","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"And I can be so much more Nidhogg. More than a servant. I can be an ally. Hear out my plea before you judge we as wantonly foolish.\" Lessons of nobility telling how the Speaker should act, though memories of how he got them are absent, they are present within him nonetheless.","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:51:55.957000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870151633059848243","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"How would you judge your worth then? You have seen how able I am. How are you able to serve me?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:54:17.236000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870152225626943519","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"(I cannot make an openly evil character option available to you here.)","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:54:42.300000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870152330752983050","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"(i don't want to be evil, nameless is just frustrated at bad deals)","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:55:33.440000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870152545249677363","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"The ravens spoke of the Gods of the Old World. Tell me are they coming for Arcania?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:56:37.810000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870152815237017630","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"If they are, all I'm asking is for you to help me, help us, defeat them. That should suffice as help given to me. After that, I am yours in any way.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:59:12.853000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870153465534480385","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"If the Old Gods are not coming, the ravens must've spoke of a different threat. Help us in that fight and our deal is done all the same.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:59:47.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870153610938437663","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"(I'm recruiting him for the final fight basically)","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:00:11.587000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870153711882756109","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I am yours to command before then and after. Just come in our time of need.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:00:48.721000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870153867634016326","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"The Gods of the Old World hunger for any advantage in their endless wars. The New World is full of power. That there is the barier of the 4 wardens is the only thing preventing Gods from entering. Demigods, and some Neutral Gods have been allowed, But  so long as Author and Odin wage war against the Evil Gods, there shall be no peace in the Old world. No demigod would ever be foolish enough to stand in their way.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:03:17.674000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870154492388200500","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"And this is no offer of service to me. This is you attempting to wield me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:04:06.451000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870154696973774868","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"No, the Gods will not come. But their servants shall continue to harvest what they can.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:05:05.276000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870154943703711755","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"There can be service to you. There is a powerful threat the ravens spoke of. Power you can harvest.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:05:49.582000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870155129536532480","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"There is also me at stake Nidhogg, do not forget. A Speaker for the Dead chosen by the ravens is not any regular mortal.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:07:36.380000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870155577479790612","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I am not eternal, yes. That is why I fight for my life.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:08:15.066000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870155739740663868","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Regret and pain have been my company these past few days. If my indefinite service to you can bring a bit of help to my city, then I shall consider it worth it. If not for want of power, then at least of pity may you hear me out.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:09:27.075000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870156041768292402","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"The nameless bows down until his head touches the floor, his hands splayed at his side. He is openly grovelling at the dragon's feet.","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:09:59.548000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870156177969922108","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"You presume much of my wants and needs. How have you used your power, speaker? Have you yet spoken of any death? Have you yet given solace or guided any souls through their time in the world of the spirits? A title is words until you fill its function. The offer I give Empire  is to return it's speaker of the dead to yet perform his function. Be of service and earn the right to so lofty a request.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:13:20.689000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-29T04:13:58.492000Z","id":"870157021616439356","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I have used my power to tell tales of and respect the dead. I am new to this role and it's responsibilities. But you yourself said this role is one with use.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:15:39.907000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870157605539037194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I admit my last visit here was for naught.\" The nameless tilts his head back up. \"That is why I am doing this, to redeem myself. I am using my power as speaker right now Nidhogg.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:16:30.414000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870157817380749393","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I am not a dead person who needs guidance. And you are no speaker until you return.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:17:27.771000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870158057953460224","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"And I shall return with a gift for the city and a body to use in your service. A fair deal between both of us. Assistance from you and my life from me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:19:07.779000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870158477417398282","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Oh, Shall you? Your terms are not yet clear. What power do you seek, and what do you think you can do that is valuable enough to me to warrant it? Be specific, I tire of the droning of an ephemeral.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:21:30.519000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870159076112363571","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"The more you speak, the more I regret indenturing you. The option to leave you in Niflhelm is quickly becoming more appealing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:22:41.561000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870159374084100157","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Give me the power to call on your help for one time and I shall offer up my whole life in your service. All my capabilities as speaker to journey the realms of living and dead, as friend to the ravens' priestesses, and as myself will be open to you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:25:50.088000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870160164823650334","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Your whole life is already forfeit to me. How can you pay me double with it?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:26:47.738000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870160406625280052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Child. You say the same thing over and over expecting a different result.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T04:27:40.233000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870160626805256202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
